Package: esqlabs.handsontable
Title: Interactive Excel-like Tables for Shiny Applications
Version: 0.0.5.9005
Authors@R:
    person("Anastasiia", "Kostiv", , "anastasiia.kostiv.ext@esqlabs.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides advanced interactive table input capabilities for Shiny
    applications using the Handsontable.js library wrapped in React components.
    Designed as an extension to the ESQapp package, it offers
    Excel-like spreadsheet functionality with features including keyboard navigation,
    copy/paste, dynamic dropdowns, custom cell editors, and real-time validation.
    The package supports multiple specialized table types for different data domains
    such as scenarios, demographics, plot configurations, and more. Bidirectional
    data flow between R and JavaScript ensures seamless reactive updates.
